# Copy to .env in the repo root and edit. Never commit .env.
#
# Python (config.py) and Slurm jobs (scripts/_env.sh) read these automatically.

# Repo checkout (optional, defaults to repo root)
# REPO_ROOT=/path/to/Q-SafeDiag

# HuggingFace model cache (~200 GB for the full paper grid)
# HF_HOME=/data/huggingface

# Pre-quantized AWQ/AQLM/GPTQ checkpoints (see scripts/fetch_checkpoints.sh)
# QM_ROOT=/data/quantized_models

# Optional Slurm / HPC (uncomment if you use scripts/*.sbatch)
# SLURM_ACCOUNT=your_account
# CONDA_ENV=/path/to/conda/env
